<title>SINGAPORE: Fu Yu first half net profit up 4.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Fu Yu first half net profit up 4.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   6.47   vs   6.17</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)     1.40   vs   1.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		   106.01   vs  74.68</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  13.22   vs  12.41</p>
<p>    Interest expense	   nil    vs   0.62</p>
<p>    Pretax			 8.16   vs   8.51</p>
<p>    Tax			    1.70   vs   2.31</p>
<p>    Minorities		   0.02   vs  (0.03)</p>
<p>- Note - Full name is Fu Yu Manufacturing Ltd.</p>
<p>-Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
